{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Iterator\/next()"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"code":"IteratorProtocol.next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/iterator\/next()"]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"next"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V8IteratorV4nextSay6VertexQzGSgyF","title":"next()","remoteSource":{"fileName":"MaximalCliques.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques.swift#L284"},"modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}],"role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"next","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"title":"Cliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"title":"MaximalCliques","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"abstract":[],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","title":"Vertex","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdenti